IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CHECK.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 N0 USAGE POINTER.
01 N1 USAGE POINTER.
01 N2 USAGE POINTER.
01 N2-V USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 5.
01 N3 USAGE POINTER.
01 N4 USAGE POINTER.
01 N4-V PIC X(8) VALUE "compile" & X"00".
01 N5 USAGE POINTER.
01 N5-V PIC X(5) VALUE "test" & X"00".
01 N1-K PIC X(5) VALUE "test" & X"00".
01 N6 USAGE POINTER.
01 N7 USAGE POINTER.
01 N7-V USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 7.
01 N8 USAGE POINTER.
01 N9 USAGE POINTER.
01 N9-V PIC X(5) VALUE "link" & X"00".
01 N10 USAGE POINTER.
01 N10-V PIC X(5) VALUE "test" & X"00".
01 N6-K PIC X(8) VALUE "package" & X"00".
01 N-STATUS PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
01 MY-DATA USAGE POINTER.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateObject" RETURNING N0.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateArray" RETURNING N1.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateNumber" USING BY VALUE N2-V RETURNING N2.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N1 BY VALUE N2 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateArray" RETURNING N3.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateString" USING BY REFERENCE N4-V RETURNING N4.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N3 BY VALUE N4 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateString" USING BY REFERENCE N5-V RETURNING N5.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N3 BY VALUE N5 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N1 BY VALUE N3 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToObject" USING BY VALUE N0 BY REFERENCE N1-K BY VALUE N1 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateArray" RETURNING N6.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateNumber" USING BY VALUE N7-V RETURNING N7.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N6 BY VALUE N7 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateArray" RETURNING N8.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateString" USING BY REFERENCE N9-V RETURNING N9.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N8 BY VALUE N9 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateString" USING BY REFERENCE N10-V RETURNING N10.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N8 BY VALUE N10 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N6 BY VALUE N8 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToObject" USING BY VALUE N0 BY REFERENCE N6-K BY VALUE N6 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    SET MY-DATA TO N0.
    STOP RUN.
